# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Into the Badlands

step Into the Badlands
  zone Badlands
  tip Head south-west out of Arathi over Thandol Span, south through the Wetlands (keep clear of Menethil Harbor) and east into Loch Modan; the road leaves Loch Modan to the south into the Badlands. Follow it south to the goblin camp in the Valley of Fangs.
  goto 42.3,52.8 "Valley of Fangs"

# Group quests (sim elites): Power Stones, about 19 min saved for a party
step Power Stones
  when group 2418
  accept 2418

step Power Stones
  when group 2418
  tip Shadowforge Surveyor is elite: grouping up is advised.
  collect 8009 quest 2418.1
  collect 8052 quest 2418.2

step Power Stones
  when group 2418
  turnin 2418

step Valley of Fangs
  turnin 1106                         -- Martek the Exiled: Fizzle's letter from the Shimmering Flats
  accept 1108
  accept 703                          -- Rigglefuzz

step The Dustbowl
  tip Head west along the road; Lotwil's camp sits in the Dustbowl halfway to Kargath.
  accept 710                          -- Lotwil Veriatus

step Kargath
  tip Kargath is the Horde fortress built into the cliffs at the zone's western edge.
  getfp "Kargath"
  sethome "Kargath"
  accept 1419                         -- Neeka Bloodscar
  accept 1420                         -- for Helgrum in Stonard, around level 42
  accept 2258                         -- Jarkal Mossmeld
  vendor nearest

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Around the Dustbowl

step Lesser Rock Elementals
  tip The small elementals drift across the flats just west of Lotwil's camp. Every rock elemental in the zone can drop Jarkal's Rock Elemental Shards: keep them.
  collect 4626 quest 710

step Lotwil Veriatus
  turnin 710
  accept 711

step Rock Elementals
  tip The bigger Rock Elementals stand on the slopes north-west of the Dustbowl; each one drops a slab.
  collect 4627 quest 711

step Lotwil Veriatus
  turnin 711
  accept 712

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The south-west

step Coyotes and buzzards
  tip The Elder Crag Coyotes and Giant Buzzards roam the basin south of the Dustbowl. Coyotes drop both the jawbones and the fangs; only the buzzards drop wings and gizzards.
  collect 6166 quest 1419
  collect 7846 quest 2258.2
  collect 7847 quest 2258.1
  collect 3404 quest 703

step Greater Rock Elementals
  tip The Greater Rock Elementals (42-44, well above you) wander the gulches in the south-west; the bracers drop about one kill in five. Pull one at a time and rest between fights, or leave them. Keep killing coyotes and buzzards you still need on the way.
  collect 4628 quest 712 optional
  collect 7848 quest 2258.3

step Kargath
  tip Head north back to Kargath.
  turnin 1419                         -- Neeka Bloodscar
  turnin 2258                         -- Jarkal Mossmeld
  vendor nearest

step The Dustbowl
  turnin 712 optional                 -- Lotwil Veriatus
  accept 716 optional                 -- Lucien Tosselwrench: only if you carry Patterned Bronze Bracers (Blacksmithing or the Auction House)
  turnin 716 optional

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Valley of Fangs and Agmond's End

step Valley of Fangs
  turnin 703                          -- Rigglefuzz

step Stonevault troggs
  tip The Stonevault troggs dig around the cave mouths south of the Valley of Fangs, on the way to Agmond's End; the Bonesnappers and Shamans drop the flakes.
  collect 5797 quest 1108

step Agmond's End
  tip Theldurin sits among the dwarven ruins at Agmond's End, south of the Valley of Fangs.
  accept 709

step Valley of Fangs
  tip Follow the road north; Martek's camp is on the way.
  turnin 1108                         -- Martek the Exiled

step Ancient Chest
  tip Keep north on the road; the chest lies in the Uldaman dig site, at the foot of the ruins north-west of the road.
  collect 4631 quest 709

step Agmond's End
  tip Head back south down the road, past the Valley of Fangs.
  turnin 709                          -- Theldurin the Lost

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- To the Barrens

step Hearth to Kargath
  hearth "Kargath"
  fly "Grom'gol"

step Zeppelin to Orgrimmar
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip Take the Orgrimmar zeppelin from the tower on the west side of Grom'gol.
  goto 31.6,29.1 "Zeppelin tower"

step Orgrimmar
  zone Orgrimmar
  train class only Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock
  accept 1718 only Warrior            -- Sorek, Valley of Honor

step Thunder Bluff
  only Druid,Paladin
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Your trainer is in Thunder Bluff, one flight from Orgrimmar: Turak Runetotem (Druids) on Elder Rise, Alodan the Hopeful (Paladins). Fly on to the Crossroads from there.
  fly "Thunder Bluff"
  train class

step The Crossroads
  zone The Barrens
  fly "Crossroads"

step Regthar Deathgate
  zone The Barrens
  tip Head north up the road from the Crossroads to the Forgotten Pools; Regthar keeps watch on the rise above the water.
  turnin 1361
  accept 1362                         -- for Felgur Twocuts in Desolace, in the next guide

step Ratchet
  tip Head back south to the Crossroads and fly to Ratchet.
  fly "Ratchet"
  sethome "Ratchet"
  buy 3713 x3 nearest                 -- Soothing Spices, for "Swamp Eye" Jarl in Dustwallow Marsh
  note The next guide heads into Dustwallow Marsh.

step The Affray
  only Warrior
  tip Head south along the coast from Ratchet to Fray Island. Klannoc Macleod stands by the arena: step on the grate to start the fight; the challengers come one at a time, then Big Will (33).
  turnin 1718                         -- Klannoc Macleod
  accept 1719
  complete 1719
  turnin 1719                         -- Klannoc Macleod: Berserker Stance
